ro liability is necessary.\",\n    \"Checked the retained SEC submissions index for the annual, interim and 2025 proxy identities. P01 explicitly leaves the mirrored annual PDF\\u2019s publication date and historical byte vintage unresolved; the plan preserves that distinction.\",\n    \"Checked the current P02 catalog entry and refreshed next plan against the packet. All six supplied controller, catalog, schema, controller-test and master-plan hashes match.\",\n    \"Skeptical audit passed: source readings replace the wrong hard-coded baseline; note counts and arithmetic are not promoted into accounting or forecast validity; unsupported extraction, context, hashes and arithmetic veto acceptance; external-access failures block their dependent claims without stopping independent work; and no performance comparison creates an unfair-comparator issue.\",\n    \"The plan identifies its material assumptions, preserves frozen evidence, and proposes artifacts that answer the phase question. pdftotext and the existing BeautifulSoup installation are available. No implementation tests, acquisition commands or project writes were performed during this review.\"\n  ],\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"AGENTS.md\",\n    \"MISSION_CONTROL.md\",\n    \"docs/plans/accounting-mission-requirements.md\",\n    \"docs/plans/accounting-product-design-checkpoint.md\",\n    \"docs/plans/accounting-master-checkpoint.md\",\n    \"docs/design/review/gap-audit-2026-10-02.md\",\n    \"docs/design/review/mission-gap-audit-2026-10-02.md\",\n    \"data/accounting-master/next-plan.md\",\n    \"data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T180732-83972f09/P02/plan-0.log\",\n    \"data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T180732-83972f09/P01/source-work-register.json\",\n    \"data/accounting-master/runs/20261002T180732-83972f09/P01/checks.json\",\n    \"scripts/accounting_master_catalog.json\",\n    \"scripts/build_real_case.py\",\n    \"scripts/core_semantics.py\",\n    \"docs/design/cases/apple/manifest.json\",\n    \"